(7511065, 1198842, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes indeed.  Such a beautiful unassuming thing, which is of course the point.  But what really grabs me by my constitutional amendments is the tulip-shaped escapee in the wall plaster.  There''s even a space below, where it escaped from.  It made me think of <i>Le Ballon Rouge</i>, one of my favourite-ever whimsies.  Thank you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-04-28 15:48:03.</i></td>', 'Yes indeed.  Such a beautiful unassuming thing, which is of course the point.  But what really grabs me by my constitutional amendments is the tulip-shaped escapee in the wall plaster.  There''s even a space below, where it escaped from.  It made me think of Le Ballon Rouge, one of my favourite-ever whimsies.  Thank you.', '2017-04-28 16:47:28.000000', '2017-04-28 16:48:03.000000', 0),
