(7511134, 1198248, 63218, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this one for days trying to think of a comment. I like it. I like all your work for the same reasons--the rich tones &amp; the satisfying presence of style. A point of view expressed without compromise. As I see it, your work is an expression of the way you see. I enjoy looking at it, purely &amp; simply that. Thanks for posting.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this one for days trying to think of a comment. I like it. I like all your work for the same reasons--the rich tones & the satisfying presence of style. A point of view expressed without compromise. As I see it, your work is an expression of the way you see. I enjoy looking at it, purely & simply that. Thanks for posting.', '2017-04-29 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
